o%20Orc%20Land\">Zao Orc Land</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace%20Antechambers\">Zao Palace Antechambers</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Palace\">Zao Palace</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppe</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Terramite%20Caves\">Zao Terramite Caves</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Wailing%20Widow%20Cave\">Zao Wailing Widow Caves</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Zzaion\">Zzaion</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/an-interest-in-botany-quest\">An Interest In Botany Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/elementalist-outfits-quest\">Elementalist Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/tomes-of-knowledge-quest\">Tomes of Knowledge Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/warmaster-outfits-quest\">Warmaster Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/wayfarer-outfits-quest\">Wayfarer Outfits Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.54<br/>December 9, 2009<br/>Christmas Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">More images</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map2\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Farmine Stages\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"146\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Farmine_Stages_1c39ef.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span></p><p><br/> </p><p><br/> </p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>A dwarfish expedition far away from <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, using the new <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a> technology, has cartographed the underwater rivers and while searching for new mines, one of the survey ships had discovered a seemingly untouched cave system with rare ores. They established a first base there, called \"<b>Farmine</b>\" but the times are rough and resources scarce so they are struggling for support to hold and expand the base. Only a few skilled <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf\">dwarfs</a> are working day and night to foster the expansion of the base, with little to eat and little to drink, little of everything. The dwarfs had already built an elevator towards the surface but found themselves right in the middle of mountains. <a href=\"#/wiki/Ongulf\">Ongulf</a>, their leader, needs help to find a way out of the mountains.<br/>\n</p><p>To gain access to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>, tavern, bank, shops and to become a citizen of Farmine, you have to complete certain missions of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-new-frontier-quest\">The New Frontier Quest</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Farmine NPCs (11 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Job</th><th style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\">Buy/Sell</th><th style=\"\">Location</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Servant%20Sentry\">Broken Servant Sentry</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Servant%20Sentry\"><img alt=\"Broken Servant Sentry\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Broken_Servant_Sentry_737172.gif\" width=\"149\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Servant</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">South of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rabaz\">Rabaz</a>, west of steamship</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\">Cael</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cael\"><img alt=\"Cael\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cael_731403.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Sage</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Farmine</strong>, north of the steamship and armory.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Esrik\">Esrik</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Esrik\"><img alt=\"Esrik\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Esrik_534078.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Artisan</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></td><td style=\"\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Farmine</strong>, north of the steamship.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Melian\">Melian</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\